start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc 15dc@ring ss@top
R2: vs@same [sk vs@st]x7 ss@top # first V st = beg 5 ch (3 ch as dc + 2 ch) + dc in same st
R3: ch sc@same [3hdc@sp 2sc]x7 3hdc@sp sc ss@top
R4: 3ch=dc sk sc sk dc 3ch [dc sk sc sk dc 3ch]x7 ss@top
R5: ch sc@same [7dc@sp sc]x7 7dc@sp ss@top
R6: 4ch=tr {2tr 2ch 3tr}@same [3ch 3sk sc 3ch 3sk dc 3ch 3sk sc 3ch 3sk {3tr 2ch 3tr}@st]x3 3ch 3sk sc 3ch 3sk dc 3ch 3sk sc 3ch 3sk ss@top
R7: 2sl sl@corner 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same [ch 3dc@sp]x4 ch [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner [ch 3dc@sp]x4 ch]x3 ss@top
R8: 2sl sl@corner 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same [ch 3dc@sp]x5 ch [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner [ch 3dc@sp]x5 ch]x3 ss@top
